# This file's allow-scripts list is SUPERSEDED by the "allowScripts" field in
# package.json.
#
# npm 11 warns: "allow-scripts .npmrc allow-scripts setting is being ignored
# because package.json declares its own allowScripts field". So the entries
# below have no effect while that field is present, and the authoritative
# allowlist is package.json's `allowScripts` — keep the two in step, or delete
# this line and rely on package.json alone.
#
# Keep this file for registry/auth settings if any are added later.
allow-scripts=@tailwindcss/oxide,sharp,unrs-resolver,@next/swc-win32-x64-msvc,@next/swc-win32-gnu-msvc
